{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI arrived in Metz this afternoon and have secured a front seat in the coupé for tomorrow’s diligence to Paris. The heat was oppressive, but I managed a walk along the ramparts before dinner. The view of the Moselle valley was quite magnificent, though the cathedral, seen only from the outside, lacks the interior grandeur one might expect. It is a sturdy building, certainly, but I confess I found the exterior somewhat austere.\n\nAfter the meal, I attended the theatre. The house was full of garrison officers, their uniforms glittering under the chandeliers. We saw a play followed by a vaudeville. The acting was competent, if not inspiring, and the music was pleasant enough to pass the time. I found the atmosphere light and sociable, a welcome change from the quiet of Berlin. I am tired but content. Please give my regards to the boys. I hope to reach Paris by evening.\n\nYours ever,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795080507,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":206,"prompt_tokens":945,"total_tokens":1151,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-W68yhH2WoXICKjBmSU3QLz3d2Gq7rLfD","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":945,"prompt_ms":1023.961,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0835566137566137,"prompt_per_second":922.886711505614,"predicted_n":206,"predicted_ms":5008.821,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.433273170731706,"predicted_per_second":40.927795183736855}}